# Butler Routes - Western Plaguelands (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (19 quests, docs/western-plaguelands-horde-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. Chain order is strictly
# turn-in-before-accept in file order: follow-up accepts always come after their
# pres' turn-ins. Out-of-contract pres (6145 Undercity-contracted, 5961
# Undercity-contracted, 9015 shared main-guide) ride dedicated when onquest
# mini-steps, each standing alone; out-of-contract chain exits (6145, 9032)
# get handoff notes. Class quests gate every line only <Class> - Shaman, Druid,
# Hunter, Mage, Priest, Rogue, Warlock, Warrior per the data bitmasks; no Paladin
# variant exists. Sourceless objectives ride bare completes with honest notes,
# never invented points. The Stratholme head goes to the data-placed markers
# with a note saying so. Expedition legs and turn-ins (Undercity, Orgrimmar)
# switch frames deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/western-plaguelands-horde
title Western Plaguelands (Horde)
levels 54-58
zone Western Plaguelands
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Eastern Kingdoms
coords live
version 1

step The Bulwark muster - Nathanos's board

  zone map 1423

  tip Nathanos Blightcaller (22.23, 63.51) holds the Bulwark board in the west.
  accept 6022 -- To Kill With Purpose - Nathanos Blightcaller; rot off the Corin's Crossing scourge, east
  accept 6042 -- Un-Life's Little Annoyances - Nathanos Blightcaller; plaguebats, center and west
  accept 6133 -- The Ranger Lord's Behest - Nathanos Blightcaller; woodsmen and the registry, north

